OL,3,GNEWSAMan given second chance after
OL,4,Acardiac arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who suffered a cardiac arrest
OL,7,Fwhile driving has become the first
OL,8,Fpatient at University Hospital Coventry
OL,9,Fto receive an innovative new heart
OL,10,Ftreatment.
OL,12,FCameron Mair, 33, was driving over
OL,13,FClopton Bridge in Stratford-upon-Avon
OL,14,Fon 21 July when went into cardiac
OL,15,Farrest, and had to be pulled out of his
OL,16,Fcar by a passing driver, who performed
OL,17,FCPR.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
PN,35402
SC,0002
