OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1788758787
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAMan given second chance after
OL,4,Acardiac arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was fitted with an Extravascular
OL,7,FImplantable Cardioverter Defibrillator
OL,8,F(EV-ICD), which monitors the heartbeat
OL,9,Fand delivers small electrical signals
OL,10,Fif it picks up abnormal rhythms.
OL,12,FMair said he was "very nervous" before
OL,13,Fthe procedure but afterwards he felt
OL,14,F"great" and now had extra protection
OL,15,Ffor the future.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
